  "notes": "COMPONENTS:\n{離|り} (leave; separate) + {陸|りく} (land)\nLiterally: \"leaving the land\"\n\nFLIGHT PHASES:\n1. {離陸|りりく}: takeoff\n2. {上昇|じょうしょう}: climb\n3. {巡航|じゅんこう}: cruise\n4. {降下|こうか}: descent\n5. {着陸|ちゃくりく}: landing\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {離陸速度|りりくそくど}: takeoff speed\n- {離陸重量|りりくじゅうりょう}: takeoff weight\n- {垂直離陸|すいちょくりりく}: vertical takeoff\n\nANNOUNCEMENTS:\nAirline announcements: 「まもなく{離陸|りりく}いたします」(We will be taking off shortly)",
